Description: preview-driven frontend for rsync
 qpy-rsync compares a source and a destination with an rsync dry run,
 shows the differences in three synchronized tree panes and only writes
 after the selected actions have been verified with a second dry run.
 .
 Every command is written to the journal before it runs, the transfer can
 be paused and continued, and profiles can be stored for recurring jobs.
